\begin{equation}
F = \frac{G M_{BH} M_s}{R^2} = \frac{M_s v^2}{R},
\end{equation}
where $v$, the (linear) orbital velocity, is related to the orbital period $P$ by
\begin{equation}
v = \frac{2\pi R}{P}.
\end{equation}
